510
00:18:50,010 --> 00:18:52,650
They're thinking that having Okkotsu near
Itadori would keep Fushiguro safe, but it
would be a more efficient use of their
forces for Okkotsu to act alone.

511
00:18:52,650 --> 00:18:54,360
Is this the time to worry about that?

512
00:18:54,980 --> 00:18:56,320
It'll be fine.

513
00:18:56,320 --> 00:19:00,190
If that happens, you can
have him kill you after I die.

514
00:19:00,190 --> 00:19:02,860
No, I'm trying to prevent that.

515
00:19:03,540 --> 00:19:04,770
Senpai.

516
00:19:04,780 --> 00:19:10,500
Megumi Fushiguro

517
00:19:04,780 --> 00:19:10,500
Yuji Itadori

518
00:19:05,070 --> 00:19:06,140
Yeah.

519
00:19:06,140 --> 00:19:08,720
You two go to see Kinji like we planned.

